# Sign-Up Submission Capture

Completed sign-ups are stored in browser `localStorage` under `insureco-signup-submissions` because this prototype has no backend integration.

- Call `saveSignUpSubmission(formData)` only from the final submit action.
- Use `getSignUpSubmissions()` in the dashboard to render every stored completion, newest first.
- Preserve the complete form record for the prototype, but only show the minimum useful identifying fields in the dashboard table: applicant name, email, requested coverage, location, and submission date.
- A real application must replace this browser-only persistence with an authenticated API and must not keep sensitive form data in browser storage.
